#: {{ux|en|The greatest '''factor''' in the decision was the need for public transportation.}}
#: {{ux|en|The economy was a '''factor''' in this year's budget figures.}}
#* '''1864-1898''', {{w|Herbert Spencer}}, ''Principles of Biology''
