|passage=If a man be bounden unto 1.s. in 100.l.£ to grant unto him the rent and '''farme''' of such a Mill.}}
#* {{quote-text|en|year=1700|author=J. Tyrrell|title=Gen. Hist. Eng. II. 814
|passage=All..Tythings shall stand at the old '''Farm''', without any Increase.}}
