#* {{quote-book|en|year=1983|author={{w|Bill Oddie}}|title=Gone Birding|publisher=Methuen|location=London|page=51|passage=From Area B I'd usually [...] do the whole thing in reverse, until I'd qualified for the reward of a bacon sandwich and a cup of '''exquisite''' milky coffee at a transport café in Bartley Green Village.}}
